HST Office: the Arrange commands of Writer's and Sheets' Layout tab and Writer's merge-field shading show their labels.

Gap list G10 (owner, 15/11/2026): outside the formatting groups a command shows its label where the reference suite
does and the ribbon has room. Writer ▸ Bố cục: text wrap (Không, Song song, Tối ưu, Trái, Xuyên qua, Phải), Nâng lên
trên, Hạ xuống dưới; Sheets ▸ Bố trí trang: Nâng lên trên, Hạ xuống dưới; Writer ▸ Gửi thư: Tô nền trường. Their
toolboxes were icon-only; they are labelled now, and the ribbon ladder still drops the labels at the small size.

